      "text": "### Grok 4.5\n\nGrok 4.5, SpaceXSI's model for coding, agentic tasks, and knowledge work, is now available on the xAI API. Priced at $2 / 1M input tokens and $6 / 1M output tokens, with configurable reasoning effort (low, medium, or high; default high). See the [Grok 4.5 overview](/developers/grok-4-5) and the [announcement](https://x.ai/news/grok-4-5)."
    }
